---
title: "signInWithDiscord (kintai-v3: OAuth Initiation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: signInWithDiscord(formData)
    q_init --> q_check_next: next = formData.get('next')
    q_check_next --> q_save_cookie: next parameter present
    q_save_cookie --> q_build_redirect: set cookie auth_next={next} (httpOnly, maxAge=600, path=/)
    q_check_next --> q_build_redirect: no next parameter
    q_build_redirect --> q_oauth_call: redirectTo = NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL + '/auth/callback'
    q_oauth_call --> q_supabase_oauth: supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({provider='discord', scopes='identify'})
    q_supabase_oauth --> q_oauth_error: error returned
    q_oauth_error --> [*]: redirect /login?error=Could not authenticate
    q_supabase_oauth --> q_oauth_success: data.url generated
    q_oauth_success --> [*]: redirect to Discord OAuth URL

    note right of q_save_cookie
        INV-001: auth_next cookie is httpOnly, secure in production, 10-minute TTL
        INV-002: Cookie stores post-auth redirect path for registration flow
    end note

    note right of q_oauth_call
        INV-003: Only 'identify' scope requested from Discord
        INV-004: Redirect URL constructed from NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL environment variable
        INV-005: Uses PKCE flow via Supabase Auth
    end note
